{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "653d9f65ee9c4109b075232164fb918a2a6e03ac130e05465610c9647f61765b", "ja": "（今日は可奈が出演する映画『悪役？令嬢』の\n撮影だ。可奈の芝居も、だいぶ板についてきたな）", "zh": "（今天是可奈出演的电影《恶役？千金》的拍摄。可奈的演技也越来越像样了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "385c2e73f251b9eabb80723958024b3cce0da267f3183b19ecfc681515ef4286", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまですっ。今のシーン、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！刚才那一幕，表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cef178dd7968789e5cd2c1e6e1d6c1f27aaeb740d516e3aa5571f907a10faf39", "ja": "お疲れさま、可奈。うん、バッチリだったと思うよ。\n清楚さと、あざとさのギャップがよく出てて……。", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈。我觉得，嗯，表现得非常棒。\n清纯与刻意卖萌之间的反差展现得很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "8c5c96ec2b457f372f749baee09be79859c51b954d97a4e26b592b4d24918143", "ja": "本当ですか？　えへへ、やった～♪\nたくさん練習した甲斐がありました！", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，太好了～♪\n练了那么多总算没白费！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "f60b864b2e7a2525127e700ad851942f1c9a571561b7c5ea96d94981342857cf", "ja": "性格がきつい子のお芝居は初めてじゃないですけど。\nちゃんとできてるかな～？って、ちょっぴり不安で……", "zh": "虽然演性格强势的孩子并不是第一次，\n但我还是有点担心……不知道自己演得好不好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "153f38b1099502cb0a342b2774118737d58b947baabb58bfebcb38660724e5ca", "ja": "そうだな……アパテットは、狡猾だもんな。\n今までの役より、大人びているというか……。", "zh": "是啊……アパテット确实很狡猾。该说是比之前演过的角色更成熟……或许吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "b735908d82bcaf246bb1804c66787dc48f06caf243ba31c4d2495e984b13f750", "ja": "こう……？", "zh": "这样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1007_p", "source_sha256": "caba3870a6b0d4f79098804085e00ec343be92ed8661e0d6e19df7272f945291", "ja": "狡猾。ずる賢い、っていう感じかな？", "zh": "狡猾。就是那种，狡猾的感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4c6f02fd6393cfd127d4654f8b0d3e6ef61ae70d11e8b025704be4980637911", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね！？　シトリム王子と連れ立って\n出ていくところとか、も～！！って思っちゃいました！", "zh": "啊，对吧！？看到她和西特里姆王子结伴离开的那一幕，我真是忍不住想说“真是的——！！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "67a471ff023187d06e2da9fed97260d8322fe3108748b489905a99bd0451e099", "ja": "サーフィアがかわいそうで……。でもお芝居だから、\n思いきってやらなくちゃだし。うう～っ！", "zh": "萨菲娅太可怜了……可是因为是在演戏，就必须放开手脚去演才行。呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c9eb8727f8ea8a659dd9148fa769cd2537c6f9a8c6c5c3fc38ebf45cd849f2cb", "ja": "今日の可奈の感じなら、心配しなくて大丈夫だ！\nお芝居の端々から、二面性を感じたからな！", "zh": "照今天可奈的状态，完全不用担心！\n从表演的细节中，我感受到了她的两面性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "45e39e06bebe14672d3b7a8cd54fe25e494c0721c9eabd0c2d448711f4f8b28d", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかった～……って、はれ？\nこれって、よろこんでいいところなのかな……？", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了～……咦？\n这时候该高兴吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "52ff66eb55bbff0ff7f980f741e408861dd5c58e791508a978172175f84b965b", "ja": "あっ、あのあの、{$P$}さん！\n私、普段はあんな悪い子じゃないですからね！？", "zh": "啊，那个那个，{$P$}先生！\n我平时可不是那种坏孩子哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4743dc01403b9391dc399f76d4c2eeb4bc23ee2e512de71dabefc06b37a6b3d3", "ja": "もちろん、わかってるよ。\n本当の可奈は、すごくいい子だからな！", "zh": "当然，我知道的。\n真正的可奈，可是个非常乖的好孩子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "4d0af21f17345fcad9741824da329c0a4a988984bc7f3c221102a0275eea2164", "ja": "な、ならよかったです～。\n……えっ。すごくいい子、ですかぁ！？", "zh": "那、那就好啦～\n……诶。说我是个特别乖的孩子，吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "a25ea5ec7825e013fc64ed9316ff2f89c292cd3682c14516bb38955e8b6ae3f8", "ja": "{$P$}さんに褒められちゃった……\nわ、わわわ、わわわわ～？", "zh": "被{$P$}先生夸奖了……\n哇、哇哇哇、哇哇哇哇～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1016_p", "source_sha256": "61727f9281699d469469a16f9b80cf80a1a6d81c103df708f164d5af21eb41b0", "ja": "可奈？", "zh": "可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "3684baac39bf4dbf21e4215019dd9f5c917a4536ffdcaa7788393e464675d2d9", "ja": "あっ、えっと、なんでもないです！\nなんでもないんですけど、えっと……。", "zh": "啊，那个，没什么！\n虽然没什么事，不过，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "9d48b38fea94f09d3843a03d18fc779b616acfb744073b0c417bd15867aaff34", "ja": "なんだか、すっごくうれしくて……アパテットみたいな\n苦手な子のお芝居も、がんばってよかったな～って！", "zh": "总觉得特别开心……能努力演好像アパテット这样自己不擅长的孩子，真是太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0444_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "d6b848dde124149f301634ea05734d4a7274b88f6ed8b5b3b3a853a4c29ddd23", "ja": "{$P$}さん、可奈に素敵な\nお仕事の機会を、ありがとうございますっ！　えへっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您给可奈\n这么棒的工作机会！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
